{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_141_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，王正月，杞伯來迎叔姬之喪以歸。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"夫無逆出妻之喪而為之也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"二、公會晉侯、齊侯、宋公、衞侯、鄭伯、曹伯、莒子、杞伯同盟於蒲。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"三、公至自會。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"四、二月，伯姬歸於宋。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"五、夏，季孫行父如宋致女。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"致者，不致者也。婦人在家制於父，既嫁制於夫。如宋致女，是以我盡之也。不正，故不與內稱也。逆者微，故致女詳其事，賢伯姬也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"六、晉人來媵。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"媵，淺事也，不志。此其志何也？以伯姬之不得其所，故盡其事也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"七、秋，七月，丙子，齊侯無野卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"八、晉人執鄭伯。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"九、晉欒書帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"不言戰，以鄭伯也。為尊者諱恥，為賢者諱過，為親者諱疾。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"十、冬，十有一月，葬齊頃公。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"十一、楚公子嬰齊帥師伐莒。庚申，莒潰。楚人入鄆。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"其日，莒雖夷狄，猶中國也。大夫潰莒而之楚，是以知其上為事也。惡之，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"十二、秦人、白狄伐晉。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_18","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"十三、鄭人圍許。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_19","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"十四、城中城。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_clt_141_20","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_141","textTraditional":"城中城者，非外民也。","sentenceOrder":20}],"overrides":{}}